    "type": "manual",
    "text": "Language requirements may be satisfied via the EALC Japanese Placement Exam; students placing above the Elementary level will have the requirement waived and begin coursework at the level indicated by the exam.\nStudents who place out of both the Elementary and Intermediate levels must still complete 8 units of East Asian-related coursework (upper or lower division) within the EALC Department to fulfill major requirements. Courses outside the department may be used in consultation with the undergraduate major advisor."
